{"description": "<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\"><strong>The Next Level of Fire & Life Safety Leadership</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\">With more than two centuries of combined history, brands like Kidde, Kidde Commercial, Edwards, GST, Badger, and Aritech have been leading the way in protecting people and property around the world. Now, we&rsquo;re taking that leadership to the next level. Kidde Global Solutions brings together the most trusted and iconic brands in safety, building upon our shared experience and expertise to address the needs and challenges of more customers in more places. With an unmatched portfolio of solutions and services, and a commitment to constant innovation we&rsquo;re elevating the standards for an entire industry &ndash; and establishing the next level of fire and life safety leadership.</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\">At Kidde Global Solutions, you&rsquo;re joining a global technology leader in fire and life safety solutions and our employees are the heart of it all. With industry-defining brands in life safety and security, you&rsquo;ll be part of a legacy of leadership working with cutting-edge technologies that protect lives and property worldwide. As a leading fire safety brand, our mission is to provide solutions that protect people and property from the effects of fire and related hazards. We&rsquo;re committed to expanding our impact and providing dynamic opportunities for growth within our team. You&rsquo;ll be part of a company that prioritizes quality, integrity, collaboration, and customer care, with the resources, training, and incentives to ensure your success every step of the way.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\">Country:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; background-color: white;\">Poland</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\">Location:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; background-color: white;\">Gdańsk</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\">Contract Type:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black;\">Full Time, CoE</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\">Role: Senior Quality Assurance Engineer</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; white-space: normal; color: #1c1c1e; background-color: #ffffff;\">We welcome talented professionals from across Europe</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; white-space: normal; color: #1c1c1e; background-color: #ffffff; float: none; display: inline;\">. </span></span></span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; white-space: normal; color: #1c1c1e; background-color: #ffffff; float: none; display: inline;\">If you&rsquo;re excited about this opportunity and willing to relocate to Gdansk, we&rsquo;d love to hear from you. We provide relocation support to help make the transition as smooth as possible.</span></span></span></span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\"><br><br></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Role Overview</strong> </span><br><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">We are looking for a Quality Assurance Engineer to join our R&D organization and validate communication-centric security solutions across both wireless (RF) and addressable (RS485-based) portfolios. In this role, you will be responsible for ensuring reliable, robust, and compliant communication between devices, gateways, control panels, and backend systems in complex, mixed-technology installations.<br><br></span><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Validate RF-based communication (including long-range, low-power alarm signaling, high-throughput image and audio transmission)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Execute RF performance and robustness tests</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Test addressable and hybrid installation (including device addressing, enrollment, topology handling)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Test protocol behaviors (eg. protocol coexistence and prioritization)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Support development of automation-based test solutions and validation setups</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Support compliance readiness for EN 50131 through structured test evidence</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Create and maintain test plans, test reports, and defect documentation</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Collaborate daily with R&D engineers, product management, and compliance teams</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Required Profile</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Engineering degree in Electronics, Telecommunications or related technical field</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Strong experience in Quality Assurance domain</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Experience in wireless systems validation, bus-based systems or hardware-related products testing (focused on communication)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Experience with performance-oriented testing (latency, range, throughput)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Practical knowledge of Sub-GHz radio systems, RF protocols, or IoT communication</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Knowledge of QA processes, methods and tools and ability to use them in practice</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Analytical, data-driven approach to testing and reporting</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Strong analytical and problem solving skills (including usage of debugging logs, traces, serial output)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Good command of English language (in writing and speech)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Additinal Qualifications</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Test automation skills using Python</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">ISTQB certificate</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Experience in Attlasian toolchain usage</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Experience with EN 50131 or similar standards</span></li>\n<li style=\"color: #000000; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">Experience in intrusion, detection or access domain</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12pt 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\">WHAT WE OFFER</span></strong></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1em; list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px; color: #1c1c1e; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Noto Sans'; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; background-color: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0.4px; font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter; text-indent: 0.4px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: inter; color: black;\">Competitive salary and benefits package:&nbsp;<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\">Meal Vouchers</span></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\">LuxMed Medical Insurance</span></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\">MultiSport Card</span></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\">IKE/IKZE Additional Pension Contribution</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\">Individuals may also be eligible for an annual performance bonus based on both individual and company&rsquo;s performance. The final compensation for this position will be set based on the individual&rsquo;s knowledge, skills, and experience as it relates to the job requirements. Kidde Global Solutions is committed to providing a competitive benefits package to our employees.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inter; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; color: black; padding: 0cm; border: 1pt none windowtext;\">Your journey with us</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0cm; color: #1c1c1e; white-space: normal; line-height: 16.8667px; background-color: white; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: inter; color: black;\">We always aim to provide a fair and valuable recruitment process for everyone. If selected, you will follow the next stages:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px; color: #1c1c1e; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Noto Sans'; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; background-color: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: inter; color: black;\">Initial call with our recruitment team</span></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 15.3333px; background-color: white; margin-top: 0cm; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px; font-family: inter; color: black;\">Up to 2 interviews with the Hiring Manager and key stakeholders<br><br></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\"><strong>World Leaders in Fire and Life Safety</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: inter;\">Kidde Global Solutions is a world leader in fire & life safety solutions tailored for complex commercial facilities to homes. Through iconic, industry-defining brands including Kidde, Kidde Commercial, Edwards, GST, Badger, and Aritech, we provide residential and commercial customers with advanced solutions and services to protect people and property in a wide range of applications, all around the globe.</span></p>", "salary": "", "remote": true, "doar_remote": true, "nivel": "Senior (5-10 ani)", "limbi": []}